   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E51H

   1 a 0000 E51H:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-51/P1] QUOTIENT consumed by a numeric PUT item: put
   4 a 0006      list(a / b).  [C079] pins the chain expr->HL / MVI A,width /
   5 a 0006      ?QICOP / ?PNVOP / ?QIOOP; expression items are accepted there
   6 a 0006      (N304 a+1).  Predicted: F005-style div lowering, then the C079
   7 a 0006      numeric tail with width 9 (bin(15) law w = min(9,
   8 a 0006      digits(32767)+4)).  H-H-refuse: DR refuses a DIV expression as
   9 a 0006      a PUT item. */
  10 c 0006   dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
  11 c 0006   put list(a / b);
  12 a 0025 end E51H;

CODE SIZE = 0028
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 38BC
END  COMPILATION
